# --- Tauri generated schemas ---
src-tauri/gen/schemas/

# The Android project is generated once, by `tauri android init`, and is ours
# from then on: it carries the Kotlin behind secure token storage, sign-in and
# background playback (see src-tauri/src/android/). It has to be committed, or a
# fresh clone — and CI — would build an app missing all three.
#
# The build glue Tauri regenerates on every build is excluded by the project's
# own nested .gitignore files, along with local.properties and the signing
# keystore config.

# Locally built APKs, kept out of the tree for hand-testing.
dist-apk/
